### 세션 만들기

POST http://localhost:8080/chat/sessionrooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: sans

{
  "title": "chicken"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.sessionId);
%}

### 세션에 첫 질문

POST http://localhost:8080/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: sans

{
  "message": "비가 너무 많이 와서 결근하려고 해. 가능할까?"
}

### 이어서 질문

POST http://localhost:8080/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: sans

{
  "message": "근거가 있어?"
}

